          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Captivate",
          "desc": "Skill hits reduce the enemy's Magical Defense (up to 3 stacks)."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Soul Impact",
          "desc": "Unleashes a shockwave in the target direction, dealing damage."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Strike a Pose",
          "desc": "Casts a love spell at the target, dealing damage and stunning them."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Heartbreaker",
          "desc": "Deals damage to random enemies within range 5 times."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Easy to pick up",
          "Reliable crowd control",
          "High burst damage"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Single-target crowd control",
          "No Mobility without flash",
          "Cooldown dependent"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nDaji is weak early since she won't have her full combo. Try to clear minion waves, but if the enemy has priority, stay under the tower and last-hit minions. Avoid trading before reaching level 4 and instead try to roam with your jungle to set them up for success.\n\n## Teamfights\nSince Daji's crowd control is single target you'll need to be patient and pick the right target to stun. Do not start fights and stay behind your tank at all times. Play around bushes to catch enemies off guard, and after using your combo, make sure to back off and reposition until your skills become available again.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nWhen hiding in a bush its best to start your combo with your Ultimate to reduce the enemy's magic resist before stunning.\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Assassin masuk abis Daji pakai control. 2) Hindarin skill poke-nya. 3) Di late hero tipis jangan deket pas skill Daji ready, gampang mati instan."
    },
